WEBVTT

00:05:56.225 --> 00:06:00.850
(Video) SCS: My dad always says,
"You are what you do, not what you say."

00:06:01.850 --> 00:06:05.350
Well, what you do makes me cry at night.

00:06:06.558 --> 00:06:10.534
You grown-ups say you love us,
but I challenge you,

00:06:10.558 --> 00:06:14.544
please, make your actions
reflect your words.

00:06:15.058 --> 00:06:19.701
SCS: That last sentence
summarizes my entire speech at Rio.

00:06:19.725 --> 00:06:24.076
Please, make your actions
reflect your words.

00:06:24.100 --> 00:06:28.683
Today, I'm a mother,
I have two little boys.